{
    "background_story": "Mooky was a notorious space pirate who roamed the galaxy in his trusty ship, the 'Maverick's Revenge'. He made a name for himself by going against the grain, engaging in antitrades that defied the conventional norms of intergalactic commerce. While others traded in valuable commodities, Mooky dealt in rare and illicit space artifacts, often stealing from the wealthy elite to give to those in need. His crew admired his cunning and bravery, and his reputation as a champion of the underdog spread throughout the cosmos. Mooky's antitrades often put him at odds with the authorities, but he always managed to stay one step ahead, leaving a trail of legend and mystery in his wake.",
